		(descr "Good Display GDC04212 4-digit 7-segment TN transflective LCD glass, 42x23x2.8 mm, 1/4 duty 1/3 bias 3.0 V, 12 pins 2.54 mm along the bottom edge (pin 1 left, front view). Leg width is not dimensioned (clip 1.4 x 0.3), so the holes are 1.7 x 0.6 plated slots. Viewing direction 6 o'clock (best seen from the pin side). Fill-port bump up to 0.5 mm on the digit-1 end. https://www.good-display.com/product/305.html")
